```java
public int rectCover(int n) {
    if (n <= 2)
        return n;
    int pre2 = 1, pre1 = 2;
    int result = 0;
    for (int i = 3; i <= n; i++) {
        result = pre2 + pre1;
        pre2 = pre1;
        pre1 = result;
    }
    return result;
}
```

