## solution

`https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/kth-smallest-largest-element-in-unsorted-array/`

- 直接法

```python
# 不满足O(n)题目要求
class Solution:
    def findKthLargest(self, nums: List[int], k: int) -> int:
        nums.sort()
