611. Valid Triangle Number

```python
class Solution:
    def triangleNumber(self, nums: List[int]) -> int:
        if len(nums) < 3:
            return 0

        nums.sort()
        res = 0
        for i in range(len(nums)):
            j = 0
            k = i - 1
            while j < k:
                if nums[j] + nums[k] > nums[i]:
                    res += k - j  # 注意: all pairs starting from i up to j-1 with j as the second element can form a valid triangle with k as the longest side
                    k -= 1
                else:
                    j += 1
        return res
```

# 18. 4Sum

`https://leetcode.com/problems/4sum/description/`

## solution

- 如何分别对四个指针去重：i,j,l,r

```python
class Solution:
    def fourSum(self, nums: List[int], target: int) -> List[List[int]]:
        if len(nums) < 4:
            return []

        nums.sort()
        res = []

        for i in range(0, len(nums)):
            if i > 0 and nums[i] == nums[i-1]:
                continue
            for j in range(i+1, len(nums)):
                if j > i+1 and nums[j] == nums[j-1]:
                    continue

                l = j + 1
                r = len(nums) - 1

                while l < r:
                    total_sum = nums[i] + nums[j] + nums[l] + nums[r]
                    if total_sum == target:
                        res.append([nums[i], nums[j], nums[l], nums[r]])
                        l += 1
                        r -= 1

                        while l < r and nums[l] == nums[l-1]:
                            l += 1  # 这里的去重不是continue
                        while l < r and nums[r] == nums[r+1]:
                            r -= 1
                    elif total_sum > target:
                        r -= 1
                    else:
                        l += 1
        return res
```

时间复杂度：O(n^3) <br>
空间复杂度：O(1)

# 283. Move Zeroes

`https://leetcode.com/problems/move-zeroes/`

## solution

```python
class Solution:
    def moveZeroes(self, nums: List[int]) -> None:
        """
        Do not return anything, modify nums in-place instead.
        """
        slow = 0  # 有效位置，本题存放第一个0的位置. 类似quick sort中的partition
        for i in range(len(nums)):
            if nums[i] != 0:
                nums[slow], nums[i] = nums[i], nums[slow]
                slow += 1
```

时间复杂度：O(n) <br>
空间复杂度：O(1)

